    "title": "Signal Bloom — Complete OSTF 4.0 Showcase",
    "description": "40-bar OSTF 4.0 complete musical showcase combining logical buses, single/multi/MPE routing, all MIDI event types, multi-voice lyrics and inherited 3.x authoring layers.",
